# Loaded only by `vite --mode test`, which is how the Playwright suite runs
# its dev server. Vite gives a mode file precedence over .env, so a real
# Turnstile site key in .env (used for local development) does not leak into
# the test run — the suite must not depend on reaching Cloudflare or on
# solving a challenge. The API skips verification too, since
# TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY is unset for that run.
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
